# Handover for UAT — CCS end-of-month netting (BOX Net CCS PlanBS) — {{BRANCH}}

Run `{{RUN_FOLDER}}` · {{DATE}} · target {{TARGET_ENV}} · agent `sigom-box-acc-configs-agent` · **for the operations /
accounting user** ([ADR 0025](../../../../../docs/decisions/0025-acc-configs-net-ccs-left-to-operations.md)).

**Nothing was configured on this screen.** The accounts BOX nets at month end for CCS are the operations user's to
define — not copied from another branch. This page says what is needed so it can be decided at UAT.

## 1. What the screen does

SIGOM *BOX - Accounting › Config. › Net EOM to CCS* (`T_BOX_NETCCS_BSPLAN_S`): each row names an **account** whose
CCS balance BOX nets at the end of the month, for an instrument, an instrument type and a strategy; one switch row
(`EOM_CCS_ACTIVE`) turns the netting on. The month-end events `5210.65` (netting) / `5211.65` (undo) post it. Details:
`docs/reference/box-acc-model.md` §8.1.

